<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Village Main half yr shr dives, no div.</title>
<headline>Village Main half yr shr dives, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	    3.0     vs   38</p>
<p>    Income after tax	     188     vs   733 loss</p>
<p>    Tax				158     vs   200</p>
<p>    Profit from operations	22     vs   278 loss</p>
<p>    Other income		   331     vs   436</p>
<p>Transfer to distributable</p>
<p>    reserve			  201     vs   1,417</p>
<p>Full name: Village Main Reef Gold Mining Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said clean-up and rehabilitation activities, in line with the environmental management programme and Nucelar Energy Act requirements, continued during the period under review.</p>
<p>As these activities were likely to continue to at least the end of the financial year, a detailed review of the company's potential rehabilitation and related closure liabilities would be undertaken at that time to determine the timing and extent of future dividend payments.</p>
<p>In view of this, no interim dividend had been declared.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
